# Copy to frontend/.dev.vars (git-ignored) for `wrangler dev --local`. Never commit real values.
# In production these are set with `wrangler secret put <NAME>`, never in wrangler.jsonc.
# The static site needs nothing. The admin sign-in needs these three (docs/admin.md explains how to make them):
# ADMIN_USERNAME=
# ADMIN_PASSWORD_HASH=      made with: npm run admin:secret -- hash
# SESSION_SECRET=           made with: npm run admin:secret -- session
# ADMIN_TOTP_SECRET=        optional two-factor, made with: npm run admin:secret -- totp
